# Normalize line endings to LF in the repository regardless of what a local
# editor/tool wrote to disk. Added 2026-09-07 after discovering nearly every
# tracked file (62 of 64 modified) had been silently rewritten to CRLF,
# which was making every diff and QA file:line reference unreliable.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Known binaries — leave untouched
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.mp4 binary
*.mov binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.docx binary
*.xlsx binary
